<description>&lt;p&gt;Thai border villages in Tak are seeking protection as fighting between Myanmar rebels and the army spills across the border, injuring a Thai woman, while Thai troops fire warning shots after clashes damage twenty Thai homes. Thai police have arrested two Singaporeans and three Thais for operating a cross-border prostitution network and have stripped the chief rabbi of citizenship in a broader foreigner crackdown. Cambodian Prime Minister Manet publicly challenged overseas opposition over Thai reports on border farmland, and Cambodia rejected Thailand’s claim to the disputed K’nar temple through heritage registration. The EU pledged $3.3 million for de-mining along the border, and UCDP recorded 35 battle-related deaths in 2024.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Thai Examiner&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxOYktYVUNmVi1wMkQ4NlRYWnRGYTYxajR1YVNlUnp4ZC00R05wQ0RmekxJa01Idi02VWRRMEFIelJjdTNVRk5YMHZWV25sSTVnUkRaOEZsRER6dGFLUnJWc093d1RBUGtMTGYwRGRhOHVoQXExdURTRi16VURHeVNRc2oxQUZYTl9STVRPZURfZWhjWTdoeDNzRmVKMkdGanlMMlN4eQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Karen News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxPdF9Xd0podzZabkQ3aWRIeDFOanlRTHhrYzZaZGgzQ1cxbkl4RE01QmRjcU50eEZTR1lVZjhXUWNUUjhuZThrUHJzcDdfRC1Ba2g5QkFPTzRGcG9yZ01SNEJCMXoxd0xQZVZNaDZRMDBVWkxCbUhSUW1xWVFPWjg4WGpJNzdTSU5KSTFpal92WW1jNzBWMTlXT3FsSW83UkhaalpMSjBmVzVCVElxdWQwczFRUjRRZjlvMmJWUmZn0gG-AUFVX3lxTE90X1d3Smh3NlpuRDdpZEh4MU5qeVFMeGtjNlpkaDNDVzFuSXhETTVCZGNxTnR4RlNHWVVmOFdRY1RSOG5lOGtQcnNwN19ELUFraDlCQU9PNEZwb3JnTVI0QkIxejF3TFBlVk1oNlEwMFVaTEJtSFJRbXFZUU9aODhYakk3N1NJTkpJMWlqX3ZZbWM3MFYxOVdPcWxJbzdSSFpqWkxKMGZXNUJUSXF1ZDBzMVFSNFFmOW8yYlZSZmc?oc=5&quot;&gt;NST Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Online Citizen&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&qu